|CKBNinja|000

|CK0Ninja are stealthy assassins who combine practiced martial techniques,
meditative enhancement, information gathering, and chained attacks. They value
Dexterity, Intelligence, and Wisdom and accept tighter armour restrictions than
ordinary warriors.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Unique assassination marks prove Guild Level, while combat GXP raises Ninja
Rank and supports skill training. Individual techniques improve through
practice. Focus and meditation prepare enhancements, and compatible attacks
can be linked into combinations with stronger resulting effects.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0fade and onmitsu conceal the Ninja, shuriken attacks at range, tsuki,
kekomi, pummel, and tsubo build martial sequences, cripple controls movement,
dimmak and heartstop provide lethal finishers, and ntrack follows a mark.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Ninja if you enjoy training individual skills, planning combos,
stealth, and deliberate target hunting more than broad armour access or a
simple automatic rotation.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBninhelp|CK0, |CKBskills|CK0, |CKBpractice|CK0, and
|CKBncheck|CK0 for progression details.|000

